   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Fast 4x upscale (UltraSharpV2)\n\nStarter workflow from **Comfortable** (Workflows screen).\n\n1. Load the image.\n2. Press **Run**: a 4x pixel upscale in seconds.\n3. For anime, pick **2x-AnimeSharpV4** in the loader (install it from *Suggested by AI → Upscale*). For real added detail, use the SeedVR2 starter instead.\n\n**Model:** 4x-UltraSharpV2"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
